# Explain a command in plain language
Output "06-explain.gif"
Set Width 800
Set Height 400
Set FontSize 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Type@60ms "yaak --explain 'find . -name "
Type@60ms '"*.log" -mtime +30 -delete'
Type@60ms "'"
Enter
Sleep 4s
